[[File:AirTaxi.png|thumb|right|225px|An air taxi on [[Coruscant]]]]
'''Taxis''' were a type of vehicle which could be hired for transportation, typically within a [[city]].<ref name="Ord">{{TCW|Orders (episode)}}</ref> They could be ground vehicles such as [[landspeeder]]s<ref name="The Living Force" /> or [[airspeeder]]s like [[air taxi]]s.<ref name="Ord" /> A [[droid]] [[pilot]]ed taxi was known as a [[Taxi droid|droid taxi]].<ref name="HttJ">''[[Heir to the Jedi]]''</ref> A company that operated taxis was known as a livery. One livery was the [[Kwikhaul Livery Corporation]] on the [[planet]] [[Kwenn]].<ref name="The Living Force" />

